   "type": "open",
   "qHtml": true,
   "q": "<style>.katex-display{overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;padding:2px 0}</style><span style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px\">Repeat Assessment · 1 Feb 2024 · Part I (f) · 8 pts</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:17px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5\">The graphical representation of the correspondence \\(H\\colon[0,1]\\rightrightarrows\\mathbb{R}\\) defined by$$\\small H(x)=\\begin{cases}[\\sqrt{x},1-2x] & x<\\frac14\\\\[2pt] [0,2x], & \\frac14\\le x\\le\\frac12\\\\[2pt] \\{1\\} & x>\\frac12\\end{cases}$$is: <span style=\"display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid currentColor;border-radius:5px;padding:0 6px;margin:0 2px;font-size:.78em;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;vertical-align:.08em\">1</span><br>The set of fixed points of \\(H\\) are explicitly given by: <span style=\"display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid currentColor;border-radius:5px;padding:0 6px;margin:0 2px;font-size:.78em;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;vertical-align:.08em\">2</span></span><details style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted)\">Show original exam item</summary><img src=\"img/feb24-f.png\" alt=\"Original exam item f\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)\"></details>",
   "a": "<p><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid currentColor;border-radius:5px;padding:0 6px;margin:0 2px;font-size:.78em;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;vertical-align:.08em\">1</span> Sketch: for \\(x<\\frac14\\), vertical segments from the curve \\(y=\\sqrt{x}\\) (below) up to the line \\(y=1-2x\\) (above); they meet at \\((\\frac14,\\frac12)\\). For \\(\\frac14\\le x\\le\\frac12\\), the region between \\(y=0\\) and \\(y=2x\\), up to \\((\\frac12,1)\\). For \\(x>\\frac12\\), the horizontal line \\(y=1\\).</p><p><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid currentColor;border-radius:5px;padding:0 6px;margin:0 2px;font-size:.78em;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;vertical-align:.08em\">2</span> \\(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left[\\frac14,\\frac12\\right]\\cup\\{1\\}\\)</p><p><p><i>Fixed points satisfy \\(x\\in H(x)\\): \\(x=0\\) since \\(0\\in[0,1]\\); every \\(x\\in[\\frac14,\\frac12]\\) since \\(x\\in[0,2x]\\); and \\(x=1\\).</i></p></p>"
